{"segs": ["PA_ja_291:0.1"], "en": "Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_291:0.2"], "en": "Tikanipāta,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_291:0.3"], "en": "Kumbhavagga", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_291:0.4"], "en": "1. The Surāghaṭa Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_291:1.1", "PA_ja_291:1.2"], "en": "“Having obtained a jar and a pot that grant all desires, the rogue—”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_291:1.3"], "en": "As long as he protects it,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_291:1.4"], "en": "so long does he thrive in happiness.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_291:2.1"], "en": "But when he is intoxicated and deluded,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_291:2.2"], "en": "Through negligence, he smashed the jar;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_291:2.3"], "en": "then, naked and destitute,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_291:2.4"], "en": "the fool suffers later.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_291:3.1"], "en": "In the same way, the foolish person who, having acquired wealth,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_291:3.2"], "en": "consumes it with negligence,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_291:3.3"], "en": "suffers later on.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_291:3.4"], "en": "“Like a rogue who has smashed the jar.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_291:4.1"], "en": "The *Surāghaṭa-jātaka*, the first.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
]
